    {
      "id": "fm-dedication",
      "source_ids": [
        "fm-dedication"
      ],
      "page": "vi",
      "canonical_kind": "epigraph",
      "en": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "quote",
          "children": [
            "To the memory of my father, Ernst Trouillot\nTo my mother, Anne-Marie Morisset"
          ],
          "centered": false
        }
      ],
      "zh": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "quote",
          "children": [
            "纪念我的父亲恩斯特·特鲁约（Ernst Trouillot）\n献给我的母亲安娜-玛丽·莫里塞（Anne-Marie Morisset）"
          ],
          "centered": false
        }
      ],
      "units": 13
    },
    {
      "id": "fm-epigraph",
      "source_ids": [
        "fm-epigraph"
      ],
      "page": "viii",
      "canonical_kind": "epigraph",
      "en": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "quote",
          "children": [
            "I am well aware\nthat by no means\nequal repute\nattends the narrator\nand the doer of deeds.\n—Sallust\nHistory of Catiline"
          ],
          "centered": false
        }
      ],
      "zh": [
        {
          "type": "block",
          "kind": "quote",
          "children": [
            "我深知，\n记述者所获的声誉，\n远不能与\n行事者\n等量齐观。\n——撒路斯提乌斯\n《喀提林史》"
          ],
          "centered": false
        }
      ],
      "units": 22
    },
